Testing that a wireless bridge member without a WDS station port at the time
of the render still gets the name prefix, so that a port that hostapd creates
later joins the hardware offload flowtable. The member is wireless by the
DEVTYPE of its uevent file. Name prefixes need Linux 6.17 or later.

-- Testcase --
{%
	fw4.load(false);
	print(fw4.resolve_offload_devices(), "\n");
%}
-- End --

